  "description": "Ragdoll physics for .NET games on BepuPhysics: builds a ragdoll from a character's skeleton (a hand-tuned humanoid profile, or a rig generated from any skeleton), takes over from the death animation at a chosen moment, lands on the game's ground and water, and writes the pose back. Not thread-safe per ragdoll; one BepuPhysics simulation per ragdoll.",
